nversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking and Responding to Suggestions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use modals and a variety of expressions to make suggestions or respond to suggestions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Shall we go to Valencia? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Nate</span>: Ok."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the words<span class=\"strong\"> should</span>, <span class=\"strong\">shall</span>,<span class=\"strong\"> let's</span>,<span class=\"strong\"> I suggest</span> and <span class=\"strong\">how about</span> to make suggestions.  <br/>You can respond to suggestions in the positive or negative.<br/><br/> <span class=\"strong\"> Positive</span> <br/>Yes, I'd like to. <br/>Ok.<br/> Yes, let's.<br/> Yes, I'd love to. <br/>Yes, that's a great idea! <br/> <br/><br/> <span class=\"strong\"> Negative</span> <br/>   No, let's not. <br/>No, I don't think so. <br/> I'd rather not. <br/>I don't feel like it."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"should\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">You should see the holy grail.<span/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shall\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Shall we go to Valencia?<span/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"let's\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Let's stay in Valencia another day.<span/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I suggest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I suggest you take a trip to the north of Spain.<span/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"how about\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How about we visit the cathedral?<span/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: Let's visit the museum. <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Theresa</span>: Great idea!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chapel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small church"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Holy Grail is in one of the small chapels."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about a trip"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "supper"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an evening meal"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is the cup Jesus used at the Last Supper."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "historian"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who studies and knows about history"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Many historians say that the holy grail is real."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "evidence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "information that proves something is true"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is evidence to show that this is the Holy Grail."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "overnight"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "for the whole night"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm staying here overnight, and then leaving tomorrow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scenery"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "natural features of a landscape"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The scenery in Valencia is amazing!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le05ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a favorite trip you took in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of 5 things to see and do in the place you chose."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell your partner about your trip. Suggest 5 things to do on this trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner about his/her trip. Ask for suggestions about what to do on the trip."}]}], "type": "sena"}